# Prior Authorization Story Simulator

An interactive AI-powered healthcare workflow simulator that teaches the Prior Authorization process through branching conversations.

## Features

- Interactive healthcare scenarios
- Patient, Provider and Insurance perspectives
- Multiple story endings
- AI-generated responses
- Appeal workflow simulation
- Decision tree visualization

## Technologies

- Python
- Claude API
- Prompt Engineering

## Learning Outcomes

- Healthcare Prior Authorization workflow
- Decision-making logic
- Interactive storytelling
- AI conversation design
